  "description": "C# bindings for the Panda3D game engine. Ships two API variants selected by the consumer's build optimization: Debug (the full surface, including debug-feature methods like collision recording/PStats — resolves against a Standard runtime, for development/JIT) and Release (the lean, NativeAOT-safe surface). A Release/optimized build compiles against the lean surface, so AOT-incompatible calls fail to compile before PublishAot is ever enabled. Override with -p:Panda3DInteropConfiguration=Debug|Release.",
